{"name": "Planet Sim", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Build factories across procedurally generated planets. Each planet has its own mix of rivers, deserts, oceans, enemies and unique landmarks, so every one plays differently. Take over planet by planet to make room for your growing colony and the colonists who need a place to live. Build space stations and bases on the Moon to make the cargo you need to colonize the next planet. Eventually, conquer the whole local star system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Biomes, rivers, ore deposits and landmarks land somewhere new on every seed, so no two starts play the same. Pick a preset or set the world rules yourself, from a relaxed sandbox to a tougher run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/40b8ac225859cab9182677f6f83b64cb.poster.avif?t=1795810343\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/40b8ac225859cab9182677f6f83b64cb.webm?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/40b8ac225859cab9182677f6f83b64cb.mp4?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drones harvest, haulers drive the roads between Logistics Hubs, and freight trains, ships and cargo planes link your far-off outposts. Route everything through hubs, or link buildings directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"536\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/cb5381bf5d624e90160f80f53b5f87ad.poster.avif?t=1795810343\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/cb5381bf5d624e90160f80f53b5f87ad.webm?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/cb5381bf5d624e90160f80f53b5f87ad.mp4?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a Launch Pad and Mission Control, put stations in orbit and set up an outpost on the Moon. Keep it supplied, and send cargo up with a mass driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/dd55356b4e1ded74ac3dc72675758c08.poster.avif?t=1795810343\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/dd55356b4e1ded74ac3dc72675758c08.webm?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/dd55356b4e1ded74ac3dc72675758c08.mp4?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colonists come down from the Ark in pods. They need homes and food from your farms, fisheries and kitchens, and many buildings won't run without a crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/efc65e41f3537cd824ceee61d2b9585c.poster.avif?t=1795810343\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/efc65e41f3537cd824ceee61d2b9585c.webm?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/efc65e41f3537cd824ceee61d2b9585c.mp4?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/>Hold your base with walls, turrets and shields, or train squads and take the fight to enemy camps. The underbrood are spread throughout the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"290\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/f6f30b7add52abf9d6866737733f9cce.poster.avif?t=1795810343\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/f6f30b7add52abf9d6866737733f9cce.webm?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/f6f30b7add52abf9d6866737733f9cce.mp4?t=1795810343\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/>The long goal. Every system you build feeds it: factories make the goods, rockets carry them to the Moon, and each shipment home opens up the next planet. Settle enough worlds and you can build the gate to a whole new galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roadmap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Here's what's in the game today and what comes next, shaped by your feedback. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"944\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/extras/0680d53b51a60c11c0ef0896300b1b2b.avif?t=1795810343\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Land on procedurally generated planets and build factory colonies across the galaxy. Harvest, haul and produce without conveyor belts, launch rockets to orbit and the Moon, and wake your colonists. Terraform each world to make it home, and hold back the enemies infesting it.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5388710/6bf0a11e982140f14cc60038ec9c4b9795fa2e63/header.jpg?t=1795810343", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Automation", "Simulation", "Base Building", "Strategy", "Colony Sim"], "developers": "Novel Studios LLC", "publishers": "Novel Studios LLC", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5388710", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uB8f-lBjP3o", "first_seen": 1795647600.0, "review_rank": 9}